      "created_at": "2020-11-12T04:11:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My Father&nbsp;&nbsp;and I&nbsp;have just starting playing Sentinels the card game. I am ok playing this&nbsp;game, but my father has no experience playing games like this. Were are playing a very simple game with Baron Blade as the villan. No enviroment, and just two heroes. Just trying to learn the basic rules. And&nbsp;what we were wondering was,&nbsp; What two heroes would be the best to play&nbsp;with?&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance</p>\n<p>God Bless</p>",
