      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-11-12T14:12:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Legacy and Ra are the two most straightforward heroes, I'd say. Though Legacy will take more damage from Baron Blade since they're nemeses.</p>\n<p>Good luck to you, my dad couldn't grasp the most basic concepts of Sentinels, so I've never gotten to play it with him. :B</p>",
