      "id": 234136,
      "name": "Rabit",
      "username": "Rabit",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-11-12T15:01:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, it's a 1-5&nbsp;<strong>player</strong>&nbsp;game, but a&nbsp;3-5&nbsp;<strong>hero</strong>&nbsp;game. If there are two players, suggestion is for each to play 2 heroes (which is what we do at home) or have one person play 2 heroes (which might be better for you so your dad can just focus on one?). Playing just 2 heroes will be nearly impossible, and will result is issues with the (H) mechanic that's used to balance the game.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>No environment will likely be a little easier, but it's not something I've ever tried and will remove a lot of the fun of the game. You might want to try a more friendly environment to help things, but I don't know what you have available to you... :-(&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:10:09.895Z",
