      "id": 234137,
      "name": "Ameena",
      "username": "Ameena",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-11-12T17:48:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My starter game is usually Baron Blade in Insula Primalis, with heroes as Legacy (usually played by me) and a choice of usually Ra, Tempest, Wraith, or Tachyon for whomever else I'm teaching. If I'm only teaching one person I use Dark Visionary as a second hero so I can control things and hopefully make the game a bit easier on the new player :D. Legacy and Ra go well together in terms of damage, and add in Insula Primalis and it can get plain silly :D.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:10:09.969Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
