      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/d26b3c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-11-14T16:46:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ra and Legacy on a team against Baron Blade on Insula Primalis is a good idea. If you don't mind trying to play two characters, I would say either Tempest or Bunker for simplicity.</p>\n<p>My group's first game was against Blade on IP, too. It went downhill after that, as one person tried Absolute Zero, and another had Ra. Ra's Imbue Fire is not a good idea when AZ can't get his gear out. We did better against Omnitron, but Omni can be a&nbsp;pain to manage with his constant flipping.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:10:10.039Z",
